  "no_go_conditions": [
    "The Retail Prices API stops serving anonymous requests or requires a subscription.",
    "A size page stops publishing the bracketed [x86-64] or [Arm64] processor architecture marker, or publishes two different markers, leaving no defensible architecture.",
    "A size page renames a contracted header cell, or labels its memory column with a third unit, which empties the parse and trips the coverage floor.",
    "The 'Cloud Services' product stops being distinguishable by productName, leaving its rate ambiguous with the virtual-machine rate for the same size.",
    "A machine has two different prices in effect at the same instant, with no rule that chooses between them.",
    "A published price needs more fractional digits than the contracted maximum.",
    "A Spot meter has no paired On-Demand meter in the same region, leaving a savings figure with no denominator.",
    "The ' Spot' sku-name suffix stops distinguishing interruptible meters from the legacy ' Low Priority' meters.",
    "Redistribution of the factual pricing and specification figures can no longer be approved."
  ]
